[[File:Attack style tab.png|right|thumb|The Combat Options tab, where weapon category is found.]]
This is a list of weapons grouped by their category, which is found in game at the bottom of the [[Combat Options]] tab. All weapons within a category use the same set of combat options. (The one exception to this is the [[3rd Age longsword]], which uses the combat options of a [[Weapons/Categories#2h sword|2h sword]] despite being one-handed and categorised as a [[Weapons/Categories#Slash sword|slash sword]].)

