==Ranged weapons==
{{Main|Ranged weapons}}
Ranged weapons can attack non-adjacent monsters from a varying ranges. When using a "Longrange" attack style, the weapon's maximum range is increased by 2 tiles; though no attack range exceeds 10 tiles. For all weapons using non-Longrange attack styles that have a range of 9 or 10, the range of its Longrange attack style will be 10.

